SkyBlockZH bundles MoulConfig 4.8.0 (NotEnoughUpdates contributors), under
LGPL-3.0-or-later. Its classes are relocated from
io.github.notenoughupdates.moulconfig to io.github.bingkkni.skyzh.deps.moulconfig.
The library's source is otherwise unmodified. License: LICENSE_moulconfig;
the corresponding GPL-3.0 text is in LICENSE_skyzh.

Project and source: https://github.com/NotEnoughUpdates/MoulConfig/tree/v4
Corresponding source archives, matching each Minecraft target:
https://maven.notenoughupdates.org/releases/org/notenoughupdates/moulconfig/modern-26.1/4.8.0/modern-26.1-4.8.0-sources.jar
https://maven.notenoughupdates.org/releases/org/notenoughupdates/moulconfig/modern-26.2/4.8.0/modern-26.2-4.8.0-sources.jar
https://maven.notenoughupdates.org/releases/org/notenoughupdates/moulconfig/modern-26.3/4.8.0/modern-26.3-4.8.0-sources.jar

MoulConfig also bundles LibNinePatch, by Juuz, under MPL-2.0.
License: LICENSE_libninepatch. Source: https://github.com/Juuxel/LibNinePatch
